# Keep interpreter bytecode out of the agent image, and out of the tree a
# successor is copied from: it is not source, and everything in the workspace
# is published as though it were.
#
# This file is applied by the orchestrator, not only by a daemon. The service
# assembles the build context itself (app/services/source_tree.py) because the
# daemon it builds on has a filesystem of its own and never sees this
# directory — and the same walk produces the manifest the seed iteration is
# recorded under, so what is excluded here is excluded from both. A hand-run
# `docker build agent/` reads it the ordinary way and gets the same tree.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
